      "output": "Develop program using Python, Oracle Procedure, Java and other tools for analytical data mining, software development, or business reporting.\nResponsible for project co-ordination related to the development and management of all project-related development, participate and manage in the design, specifications, coding, testing and implementation of bank’s application program and business reporting.\nLead and facilitate sessions with business units to gather requirements, refine and document use cases, business rules, scenarios, and data, as well as functional systems requirements throughout the development lifecycle.\nInvestigate and resolve application-related problems.\nProvide second-level support for the bank’s application system, including after-hour support as required.\n\nUndergraduate degree in Computer Science and Data Science related fields;\nBe familiar with Python, SQL, BI report tools and Java;\nGood working knowledge of project management;\nExcellent customer service skills;\nAble to communicate and writing skills in English and Mandarin or Cantonese;\nAbility to set priorities and work efficiently under pressure of high volume;\nMust be an independent problem solver with troubleshooting, decision making and analytical skills.",
